⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
270 calories 40g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included)

Red Velvet Cake Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Full recipe book (160+ flavors) linked in bio!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)  
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 1 tsp Red Velvet extract (I used LorAnn's Red Velvet Bakery Emulsion)
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- ½ of a Prime Bites Red Velvet Brownie
270 cal 13g C, 9g F, 40g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if very powdery
5. Top with the chopped brownie pieces and mix in by hand

